 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair came in at 22% of normal, and September to October did the same at 22%. In 2026 so far, March to April sits at 23% of normal. Every one of the 6 grids had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
